## Attribution notice

When adapting the standard, state the version you adapted and that changes were made. Modified
versions should not be distributed as "Balanced Plain English" without indicating the modification,
because the evidence in this repository was collected against version 1.1.0 specifically and does
not transfer to altered text.

Suggested attribution:

```text
Based on "Balanced Plain English" v1.1.0 by Julius Frelan Cabias,
licensed under CC BY 4.0. Modified.
```
